  "siteName": "GitHubDaily",
  "content": "<html>\n <head></head>\n <body>\n  <p>原创 <span>小&nbsp;G</span> <span>2026-08-11 18:05</span> <span style=\"display: inline-block;\">广东</span></p>\n  <p><img src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260811150520_2725a3a.jpeg\"></p>\n  <p style=\"box-sizing: border-box;line-height: 1.8em;orphans: 4;margin: 0px 5px 2em !important;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.1em;white-space: pre-wrap;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;SF Pro&quot;, sans-serif;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;text-align: start;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">现在用 AI 做产品实在太容易了，一个想法丢给 Agent 编程工具，半天就能完成部署上线。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"box-sizing: border-box;line-height: 1.8em;orphans: 4;margin: 2em 5px !important;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.1em;white-space: pre-wrap;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;SF Pro&quot;, sans-serif;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;text-align: start;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">身边有很多朋友已经这么干，而且做出来的产品还是有模有样的。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"box-sizing: border-box;line-height: 1.8em;orphans: 4;margin: 2em 5px !important;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.1em;white-space: pre-wrap;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;SF Pro&quot;, sans-serif;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;text-align: start;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">但我发现不少人让产品上线后，便撒手不管，从来没有关注到安全这一块处理。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"box-sizing: border-box;line-height: 1.8em;orphans: 4;margin: 2em 5px !important;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.1em;white-space: pre-wrap;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;SF Pro&quot;, sans-serif;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;text-align: start;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">很多时候 AI 会给我们埋下不少安全坑，比如权限没有收紧，数据库没有做验证等等。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"box-sizing: border-box;line-height: 1.8em;orphans: 4;margin: 2em 5px !important;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.1em;white-space: pre-wrap;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;SF Pro&quot;, sans-serif;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;text-align: start;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">网站初期还好，如果流量上来了就会不断受到攻击，甚至严重到泄露用户数据。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"box-sizing: border-box;line-height: 1.8em;orphans: 4;margin: 2em 5px !important;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.1em;white-space: pre-wrap;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;SF Pro&quot;, sans-serif;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;text-align: start;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">最近 OpenAI 悄然把自家的安全插件&nbsp;</span></span><strong style=\"box-sizing: border-box;color: rgb(34, 107, 163);\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">Codex Security</span></span></strong><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">&nbsp;开源，给我们提供了解决方案。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"box-sizing: border-box;line-height: 1.8em;orphans: 4;margin: 2em 5px !important;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.1em;white-space: pre-wrap;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;SF Pro&quot;, sans-serif;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;text-align: start;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img alt=\"image-20260811170706696\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-imgfileid=\"310511487\" data-ratio=\"0.899074074074074\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;image-orientation: from-image;height: auto;display: block;margin: auto;\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260811150521_8d32df5.png\"></p>\n  <p style=\"box-sizing: border-box;line-height: 1.8em;orphans: 4;margin: 2em 5px !important;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.1em;white-space: pre-wrap;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;SF Pro&quot;, sans-serif;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;text-align: start;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">这个安全插件的前身，是 2025 年 10 月 OpenAI 发布的 Aardvark。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"box-sizing: border-box;line-height: 1.8em;orphans: 4;margin: 2em 5px !important;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.1em;white-space: pre-wrap;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;SF Pro&quot;, sans-serif;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;text-align: start;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">一个由 GPT-5 驱动的 Agent 安全研究员，能读代码、找漏洞、确认风险再交给人处理。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"box-sizing: border-box;line-height: 1.8em;orphans: 4;margin: 2em 5px !important;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.1em;white-space: pre-wrap;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;SF Pro&quot;, sans-serif;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;text-align: start;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">到了今年 3 月，Aardvark 才更名为 Codex Security，并以插件的形式整合进 Codex。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"box-sizing: border-box;line-height: 1.8em;orphans: 4;margin: 2em 5px !important;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.1em;white-space: pre-wrap;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;SF Pro&quot;, sans-serif;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;text-align: start;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">再到上个月底，OpenAI 决定把它开源出来，并且是以谁都能安装使用的 npm 包开放。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"box-sizing: border-box;line-height: 1.8em;orphans: 4;margin: 2em 5px !important;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.1em;white-space: pre-wrap;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;SF Pro&quot;, sans-serif;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;text-align: start;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">还可以通过 OpenRouter、Fireworks 和 Amazon Bedrock 接入第三方模型。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"box-sizing: border-box;line-height: 1.8em;orphans: 4;margin: 2em 5px !important;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.1em;white-space: pre-wrap;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;SF Pro&quot;, sans-serif;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;text-align: start;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">不再绑定在 Codex 上，而且带有 CLI 命令行工具和 TypeScript SDK。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"box-sizing: border-box;line-height: 1.8em;orphans: 4;margin: 2em 5px !important;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.1em;white-space: pre-wrap;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;SF Pro&quot;, sans-serif;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;text-align: start;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">这也意味着 Claude Code、Cursor 这些 Agent 工具，也能把它装上当安全外挂。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"box-sizing: border-box;line-height: 1.8em;orphans: 4;margin: 2em 5px !important;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.1em;white-space: pre-wrap;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;SF Pro&quot;, sans-serif;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;text-align: start;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">在终端里，只需要一条命令，便能让它帮我们从原项目里找漏洞、验证漏洞、给修复方案。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"box-sizing: border-box;line-height: 1.8em;orphans: 4;margin: 2em 5px !important;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.1em;white-space: pre-wrap;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;SF Pro&quot;, sans-serif;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;text-align: start;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img alt=\"image-20260811170953906\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-imgfileid=\"310511490\" data-ratio=\"0.7870370370370371\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;image-orientation: from-image;height: auto;display: block;margin: auto;\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260811150521_63fd78a.png\"></p>\n  <p style=\"box-sizing: border-box;line-height: 1.8em;orphans: 4;margin: 2em 5px !important;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.1em;white-space: pre-wrap;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;SF Pro&quot;, sans-serif;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;text-align: start;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">中间验证这一步，Codex Security 在找到疑似漏洞时，它还会继续验证推演。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"box-sizing: border-box;line-height: 1.8em;orphans: 4;margin: 2em 5px !important;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.1em;white-space: pre-wrap;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;SF Pro&quot;, sans-serif;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;text-align: start;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">确认风险存在，便附上问题位置和修复建议，并写进报告，后续我们可以让 AI 逐一处理。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"box-sizing: border-box;line-height: 1.8em;orphans: 4;margin: 2em 5px !important;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.1em;white-space: pre-wrap;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;SF Pro&quot;, sans-serif;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;text-align: start;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">之前用传统安全扫描器，一次给我甩过来几百条告警，大半是误报，修都不知道从哪修起。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"box-sizing: border-box;line-height: 1.8em;orphans: 4;margin: 2em 5px !important;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.1em;white-space: pre-wrap;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;SF Pro&quot;, sans-serif;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;text-align: start;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">而 Codex Security 自己会先验证，确实能帮我们节省不少事。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"box-sizing: border-box;line-height: 1.8em;orphans: 4;margin: 2em 5px !important;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.1em;white-space: pre-wrap;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;SF Pro&quot;, sans-serif;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;text-align: start;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">至于安装提供了几种方式，喜欢在终端命令行使用的，执行三条命令即可：</span></span></p>\n  <p class=\"code-snippet__fix code-snippet__js\"></p>\n  <ul class=\"code-snippet__line-index code-snippet__js\"></ul>\n  <pre class=\"code-snippet__js\" data-lang=\"nginx\"><code><span leaf=\"\"><span class=\"code-snippet__comment\"># 安装依赖包</span></span></code><br><code><span leaf=\"\"><span class=\"code-snippet__attribute\">npm</span>&nbsp;install&nbsp;<span class=\"code-snippet__variable\">@openai</span>/codex-security</span></code><br><code><span leaf=\"\"><span class=\"code-snippet__comment\"># 通过 OpenAI 授权登录</span></span></code><br><code><span leaf=\"\">npx&nbsp;<span class=\"code-snippet__variable\">@openai</span>/codex-security login</span></code><br><code><span leaf=\"\"><span class=\"code-snippet__comment\"># 在项目根目录下开始扫描</span></span></code><br><code><span leaf=\"\">npx&nbsp;<span class=\"code-snippet__variable\">@openai</span>/codex-security scan .</span></code><br></pre>\n  <p></p>\n  <p style=\"box-sizing: border-box;line-height: 1.8em;orphans: 4;margin: 2em 5px !important;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.1em;white-space: pre-wrap;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;SF Pro&quot;, sans-serif;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;text-align: start;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">想在 Codex 上使用，直接在桌面端插件页面，搜索「Codex Security」安装即可使用。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"box-sizing: border-box;line-height: 1.8em;orphans: 4;margin: 2em 5px !important;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.1em;white-space: pre-wrap;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;SF Pro&quot;, sans-serif;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;text-align: start;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img alt=\"image-20260811171347793\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-imgfileid=\"310511489\" data-ratio=\"0.8435185185185186\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;image-orientation: from-image;height: auto;display: block;margin: auto;\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260811150521_102a6b1.png\"></p>\n  <p style=\"box-sizing: border-box;line-height: 1.8em;orphans: 4;margin: 2em 5px !important;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.1em;white-space: pre-wrap;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;SF Pro&quot;, sans-serif;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;text-align: start;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">若我们是使用 Claude Code，可以先把项目地址发给它帮我们安装这个工具。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"box-sizing: border-box;line-height: 1.8em;orphans: 4;margin: 2em 5px !important;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.1em;white-space: pre-wrap;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;SF Pro&quot;, sans-serif;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;text-align: start;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">接着 OpenAI 授权登录或填写 OpenRouter API Key 指定模型也能使用，稍微麻烦。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"box-sizing: border-box;line-height: 1.8em;orphans: 4;margin: 2em 5px !important;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.1em;white-space: pre-wrap;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;SF Pro&quot;, sans-serif;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;text-align: start;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">工具提供了&nbsp;</span></span><code style=\"box-sizing: border-box;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;;text-align: left;vertical-align: initial;margin: auto 5px;padding: 2px 4px;border-radius: 2px;color: rgb(0, 188, 212);background-color: rgba(27, 31, 35, 0.05);font-size: 14px;white-space: pre-wrap;display: inline;\"><span leaf=\"\">Standard</span></code><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">&nbsp;和&nbsp;</span></span><code style=\"box-sizing: border-box;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;;text-align: left;vertical-align: initial;margin: auto 5px;padding: 2px 4px;border-radius: 2px;color: rgb(0, 188, 212);background-color: rgba(27, 31, 35, 0.05);font-size: 14px;white-space: pre-wrap;display: inline;\"><span leaf=\"\">Deep</span></code><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">&nbsp;两个扫描模式。日常检查用 Standard，大版本上线前再开 Deep。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"box-sizing: border-box;line-height: 1.8em;orphans: 4;margin: 2em 5px !important;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.1em;white-space: pre-wrap;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;SF Pro&quot;, sans-serif;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;text-align: start;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">Deep 模式还可以让多个 worker 并行深挖，因此我觉得比较适合大版本上线前做一次整体扫描。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"box-sizing: border-box;line-height: 1.8em;orphans: 4;margin: 2em 5px !important;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.1em;white-space: pre-wrap;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;SF Pro&quot;, sans-serif;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;text-align: start;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img alt=\"image-20260811171154860\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-imgfileid=\"310511488\" data-ratio=\"0.4101851851851852\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;max-width: 100%;vertical-align: middle;image-orientation: from-image;height: auto;display: block;margin: auto;\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1080\" src=\"https://media.bestblogs.dev/20260811150520_cb14218.png\"></p>\n  <p style=\"box-sizing: border-box;line-height: 1.8em;orphans: 4;margin: 2em 5px !important;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.1em;white-space: pre-wrap;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;SF Pro&quot;, sans-serif;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;text-align: start;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">当让 AI 修完之后再扫一次，可以通过&nbsp;</span></span><code style=\"box-sizing: border-box;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;;text-align: left;vertical-align: initial;margin: auto 5px;padding: 2px 4px;border-radius: 2px;color: rgb(0, 188, 212);background-color: rgba(27, 31, 35, 0.05);font-size: 14px;white-space: pre-wrap;display: inline;\"><span leaf=\"\">scans compare</span></code><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">&nbsp;命令对比前后两次结果。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"box-sizing: border-box;line-height: 1.8em;orphans: 4;margin: 2em 5px !important;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.1em;white-space: pre-wrap;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;SF Pro&quot;, sans-serif;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;text-align: start;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">哪些新增、复发、已经解决的问题都会分开标出来，不用自己对着两份报告找不同。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"box-sizing: border-box;line-height: 1.8em;orphans: 4;margin: 2em 5px !important;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.1em;white-space: pre-wrap;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;SF Pro&quot;, sans-serif;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;text-align: start;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">提醒一下，使用 Deep 深度扫描模式，耗时会较长而且会消耗大量的 Token。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"box-sizing: border-box;line-height: 1.8em;orphans: 4;margin: 2em 5px !important;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.1em;white-space: pre-wrap;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;SF Pro&quot;, sans-serif;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;text-align: start;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">不过最近 OpenAI 经常搞重置，大家可以趁这段时间，对自己现有的项目都扫一次。</span></span></p>\n  <h3 style=\"box-sizing: border-box;white-space: pre-wrap;break-after: avoid-page;break-inside: avoid;orphans: 4;font-size: 16px;margin: 1.2em 5px !important;padding: 5px 0px;text-align: left;color: rgb(0, 181, 173) !important;font-weight: bold !important;font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;SF Pro&quot;, sans-serif;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;letter-spacing: normal;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">写在最后</span></span></h3>\n  <p style=\"box-sizing: border-box;line-height: 1.8em;orphans: 4;margin: 2em 5px !important;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.1em;white-space: pre-wrap;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;SF Pro&quot;, sans-serif;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;text-align: start;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">在撰写这篇文章的时候，我发现在安全问题上发力的不止 OpenAI 一家。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"box-sizing: border-box;line-height: 1.8em;orphans: 4;margin: 2em 5px !important;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.1em;white-space: pre-wrap;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;SF Pro&quot;, sans-serif;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;text-align: start;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">其实在 Claude Code 里也有一个安全插件 Security Guidance，在写完代码、结束任务和提交 commit 时都能做检查。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"box-sizing: border-box;line-height: 1.8em;orphans: 4;margin: 2em 5px !important;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.1em;white-space: pre-wrap;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;SF Pro&quot;, sans-serif;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;text-align: start;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">国内这边，阿里的编程工具 Qoder 也有类似的安全插件 Qoder Security。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"box-sizing: border-box;line-height: 1.8em;orphans: 4;margin: 2em 5px !important;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.1em;white-space: pre-wrap;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;SF Pro&quot;, sans-serif;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;text-align: start;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">几家头部 AI 巨头不约而同地在做同一件事，说明他们对 AI 写出来的代码安全问题重视。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"box-sizing: border-box;line-height: 1.8em;orphans: 4;margin: 2em 5px !important;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.1em;white-space: pre-wrap;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;SF Pro&quot;, sans-serif;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;text-align: start;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">在我看来，这会慢慢变成 AI 编程工具内置的常规扫描动作，就像写完代码要跑测试一样。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"box-sizing: border-box;line-height: 1.8em;orphans: 4;margin: 2em 5px !important;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.1em;white-space: pre-wrap;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;SF Pro&quot;, sans-serif;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;text-align: start;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">如果我们手上正好有个 Vibe Coding 出来的产品挂在公网上，可以先拿 Codex Security 跑一遍。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"box-sizing: border-box;line-height: 1.8em;orphans: 4;margin: 2em 5px !important;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.1em;white-space: pre-wrap;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;SF Pro&quot;, sans-serif;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;text-align: start;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">虽然它代替不了人工审查，但能在出事之前揪出一两个真漏洞，这轮扫描就值了。</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"box-sizing: border-box;line-height: 1.8em;orphans: 4;margin: 2em 5px !important;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.1em;white-space: pre-wrap;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;SF Pro&quot;, sans-serif;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;text-align: start;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">GitHub 项目地址：</span></span><span leaf=\"\"><a href=\"https://github.com/openai/codex-security\" target=\"_blank\">https://github.com/openai/codex-security</a></span></p>\n  <p style=\"box-sizing: border-box;line-height: 1.8em;orphans: 4;margin: 2em 5px !important;font-size: 15px;letter-spacing: 0.1em;white-space: pre-wrap;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);font-family: &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;SF Pro&quot;, sans-serif;font-style: normal;font-variant-ligatures: normal;font-variant-caps: normal;font-weight: 400;text-align: start;text-indent: 0px;text-transform: none;widows: 2;word-spacing: 0px;-webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-decoration-thickness: initial;text-decoration-style: initial;text-decoration-color: initial;\"><span style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><span leaf=\"\">今天的分享到此结束，感谢大家抽空阅读，我们下期再见，Respect！</span></span></p>\n  <p style=\"display: none;\"><mp-style-type data-value=\"3\"></mp-style-type></p>\n </body>\n</html>",
  "aiSummary": "OpenAI 开源了其安全插件 Codex Security，旨在通过 Agent 模式自动识别、验证并修复 AI 辅助编程中产生的安全漏洞。",
  "oneSentenceSummary": "OpenAI 开源了其安全插件 Codex Security，旨在通过 Agent 模式自动识别、验证并修复 AI 辅助编程中产生的安全漏洞。",
  "summary": "文章介绍了 OpenAI 最新开源的安全插件 Codex Security（其前身为 Aardvark）。该工具旨在解决 AI 辅助编程（如 Vibe Coding）带来的安全隐患，例如权限控制不当或数据库验证缺失等问题。Codex Security 不仅能扫描代码漏洞，还能通过 Agent 机制进行风险验证，有效降低了传统扫描器的高误报率。它以 npm 包形式发布，支持 CLI 和 TypeScript SDK，可接入 OpenRouter、Amazon Bedrock 等第三方模型，并能作为安全外挂集成到 Claude Code、Cursor 等主流 AI 编程工具中。文章还介绍了 Standard 与 Deep 两种扫描模式，并指出 AI 安全检查正成为行业标配。",
  "mainPoints": [
    {
